<title>FRANCE: Drive towards EMU irreversible, says EU's de Silguy.</title>
<headline>Drive towards EMU irreversible, says EU's de Silguy.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Commissioner for Economic and Monetary Affairs Yves Thibault de Silguy said on Friday the drive toward a single currency was irreversible and that the euro would be launched on time in January 1999.</p>
<p>&quot;The movement is irreversible,&quot; he said in an interview with France Info radio.</p>
</text>
